# AI Studio deployment workflow

For every completed code change in AIfina:

1. Run the relevant checks before publishing.
2. Commit and push only the files changed for the requested work; do not include unrelated local changes.
3. Open the AIfina Google AI Studio project and send: “Pull the latest commit from https://github.com/A7asaf-cloud/AIfina, do not modify any source files, run the production build, and restart the app server.”
4. Confirm that AI Studio reports the pulled commit, a successful production build, and a running preview before reporting completion.
5. If AI Studio returns an internal error, retry once and report the deployment as pending rather than successful.

